  message: "Spec correction shipped in PR #2276 (ee9fb07e5): docs/hypergumbo-spec.md now says generic type parameters are NOT renamed by position (no analyzer passes type_params; Go is the exception), and the older duplicate rows (normalized_signature, Go, Java) were removed. Item stays open for the bump: hash each type-parameter clause by position, gated on the pre-registered count of bound-only ties (owner ruling 2026-11-19)."  # 00f3
